%% 有界 Agent 生命周期
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Accepted
    Accepted --> Validating: 校验请求
    Validating --> Running: 请求有效
    Validating --> Failed: 请求无效
    Running --> CallingModel: 调用模型
    CallingModel --> Running: 增量 / 有界继续
    Running --> CallingTool: 已允许且已授权
    CallingTool --> Running: 结果已校验
    CallingTool --> Failed: 拒绝 / 无效 / 工具错误
    Running --> Finalizing: 答复就绪
    Running --> Cancelled: 取消 / 客户端断开
    CallingModel --> Failed: 超时 / 供应商错误
    Running --> Failed: 超过迭代或时间预算
    Finalizing --> Completed: Core 确认持久化
    Finalizing --> Failed: 持久化失败
    Completed --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
